OL,5,G1600 Nightmare Tenants, Slum Landlords
OL,6,     FAfter moving abroad for work, a
OL,7,     Flandlord discovers that his
OL,8,     Ftenants have left him over 20,000
OL,9,     Fpounds behind with his mortgage.
OL,10,G1700 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,11,G     Speeders
OL,12,     FNorthumbria Police deal with an
OL,13,     Fangry van driver who has no MOT.
OL,14,     FAnd a PC faces a suspected drug
OL,15,     Fdriver whose vocal boyfriend won't
OL,16,     Fcome quietly.
